From 9ae883f8c54af9c9103687f3aab95829d43bd010 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shapey Review <review@shapey.local>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:29:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] chore: add .gitignore and track the worker dependency
 lockfile

The repository had no .gitignore, so local machine-generated development
artifacts (npm's node_modules and wrangler dev's .wrangler/ miniflare
SQLite state) risked being committed. Ignore both directories.

Also track worker/package-lock.json so the installed dependency tree
(playwright 1.64.0, ws 8.18.3 devDependencies) is reproducible from the
manifests. No installed dependencies or dev-state files are added to
the repository itself.
---
 .gitignore               |  3 ++
 worker/package-lock.json | 68 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 71 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .gitignore
 create mode 100644 worker/package-lock.json

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e65330a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+node_modules/
+.wrangler/
+worker/.wrangler/
diff --git a/worker/package-lock.json b/worker/package-lock.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d400971
--- /dev/null
+++ b/worker/package-lock.json
@@ -0,0 +1,68 @@
